# Privacy

## This website

This is a static documentation site. It sets no cookies and runs no analytics or tracking
scripts. Your theme preference (light/dark) is stored in your browser's local storage and never
leaves your device.

The site is hosted on GitHub Pages; GitHub may collect technical data such as IP addresses in its
server logs; see
[GitHub's privacy statement](https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement).

### Embedded forms and boards

Some pages embed sign-up forms from Microsoft Forms and Google Forms, and event pages may embed a
read-only Airtable view or link to Airtable forms. Loading those pages fetches content from
Microsoft, Google or Airtable. That provider processes anything you submit through its form, under
its own privacy policy. We only receive the answers you submit.

## Cluster accounts

When you request access to a P1 cluster, we process the information you provide: name, university
email, affiliation and research description. We use it to create and administer your account,
verify eligibility, and conduct the periodic user reviews described in the [terms](/terms/). We
share account information with the institution that hosts the cluster you request (DTU, NGC or
DCAI). That institution operates the system and is your point of technical support.

## Research data on the clusters

Data you store or process on the clusters is governed by the hosting institution's policies, not
by this site. For projects with personal or sensitive data, use the [P1 NGC HPC](/providers/ngc/).
Each project there must carry a signed Data Processing Agreement naming NGC as data processor. See the [terms](/terms/) and the per-cluster pages for
details. Data retention and deletion after account expiry follow the
[data retention policy](/terms/#data-retention-policy). For data under a data use agreement that
is not personal data, see [RFC 0001](/rfc/0001/), which is open for comments.

## Contact

Questions about privacy or your data:
[compute-governance-p1@aicentre.dk](mailto:compute-governance-p1@aicentre.dk).

